# Compatibility

As tested in this repository, not a stability promise. Development
`main`.

| Surface | As tested |
| --- | --- |
| Development OS | macOS (`macos-latest` CI), Ubuntu Linux (`ubuntu-latest` CI) |
| Windows development | OS webview; not in the CI matrix |
| Preview webview | macOS WebKit; Linux WebKitGTK 4.1; Windows system webview |
| Desktop bundle | Ad-hoc macOS `.app` only |
| Release server | `rocci build --release` with musl/glibc targets listed by `--target` |
| Architecture | CI covers the GitHub-hosted runners above |
| Rust | `dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable`, edition 2024 crates |
| Roc (documented / CI Linux site) | nightly-2026-08-23 (`fb208ba`), `docker/install-roc.sh` |
| Roc (maintainer macOS, 2026-08-25) | nightly-2026-08-23 (`fb208ba`) |
| Datastar JS pin | `1.0.2` in application `rocci.toml` (`[assets] datastar`); `run` does not auto-upgrade |
| Editors | VS Code and Zed language registration; treat as experimental |
| Packaging | Source clone and `cargo` build. GitHub Release archives are experimental. crates.io and Homebrew are absent. |
| Known limits | Title/path finder only; reserved `@island` unimplemented; no production signing |

GitHub Release archives (macOS aarch64, Linux x86_64) are **experimental**.
crates.io is not an install path (**removed** / absent).

**Related:** [Install](/docs/install/), [Project status](/project/status/).
